WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.740
Chara-su!

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.730
Is everyone shugo-peppy today?

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.090
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:10.710
Memorize the dance
together with us!

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.260
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:13.520
Unlock!

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:45.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:51.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:59.140
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:02.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:22.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:49.980
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:52.280
"Switch!"

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:56.600
Will this cinch first place for team Ran?

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:03.170
What is it?

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:04.810
I wonder what this is?

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.920
It looks like some
kind of switch?

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.080
Let's push it!

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.290
Huh? But we don't know
what might happen!

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:14.730
It could be a trigger
for a bomb.

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:19.330
Just kidding!

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:21.870
I wouldn't press
it if I were you!

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:23.110
Let's go, Ran!

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:25.040
But I wanna know!

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.120
Huh? Nothing happened?

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:34.750
Aww, the switch didn't
do anything.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.890
Miki, Su?

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:42.050
Could it be...

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.680
Time has stopped?!

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:49.550
Amazing... Nothing is moving
except for me!

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:55.980
Oh, honestly... Fighting again?

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:58.740
I just had a <i>good</i> idea...

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.090
They can't fight while they're
barreled over in laughter!

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:03.870
Yes!

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.050
Dango...

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.930
Oh, I see, they're
having a snack.

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:17.000
Just a bite won't hurt...

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.470
Yum!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.260
Another bite won't hurt...

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:30.480
Sorry! I ate all the dango!

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:33.120
Phew, that was fun.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:34.770
Hey, I was just...

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.380
Oh, right.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:43.850
It's sad not having
anyone to talk to.

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:48.550
What's wrong with your face?

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:49.610
Same to you!

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:52.330
Huh? Where'd all
our dango go?

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:54.010
Don't do it!

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:54.860
Huh?

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.460
Didn't you just press
the switch?

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.000
N-No I didn't!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.400
Perhaps it was my
imagination.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:03.270
Maybe I should try pressing
it after all...

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:04.300
No!

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.690
Why not?

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:09.850
Because, this is a switch
that makes you lonely.

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:12.930
See you again!

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.510
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia,
Character Transformations!

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:17.920
Up first is...

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:22.140
Beat Jumper and Yamato
Maihime!

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:26.620
Beat Jumper is the form that Nagihiko takes
when he Character Transforms with Rhythm!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:32.900
His special technique uses a magical basketball
to hit the enemy, Blaze Shoot!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.960
And Yamato Maihime is Nadeshiko and
Temari's Character Transformation.

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:47.340
Her special attack makes flower petals dance about and wraps
up enemies in her obi, Dance of the Cherry Blossoms!

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:50.320
Continuing, we'll be
introducing...

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:54.250
Amulet Angel and
Amulet Devil!

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:59.230
Amulet Devil is the form Amu takes when
she Character Transforms with Il!

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:03.610
Her special attack strums a chord
on her guitar, Devil's Tune!

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:07.330
And Amulet Angel is Amu and El's
Character Transformation!

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:08.880
Really cute!

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:12.940
Her special ability is surrendering
herself, White Flag!

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.690
Well, El is a pacifist, after all.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:21.430
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia! Until next time!

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:26.480
Shugo-shugo Dance Lesson!

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:30.180
Let's split up "Thank you! I'm so Grateful!"'s
dance into four parts and memorize it!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.720
Today's Lesson 3!

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.640
First, look at the
Egg's example...

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:40.930
sou ieba ima made chanto

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:43.520
Let's try this far together.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:45.070
Step 1...

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:48.560
Step and heel and
step and heel...

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:53.600
And with your hands: Spin
and hold, spin and hold...

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:58.350
Next, raise up both hands,
spin yourself about!

00:05:58.730 --> 00:05:59.790
Okay?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.700
Once more with the music.

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:07.080
sou ieba ima made chanto

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.470
Could you do it?

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.470
Next, look at the
next dance step!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:21.020
ienakatta kotoba ga arun da

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:25.420
Let's try this far together.

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:27.620
Do the previous steps 4 times!

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:33.960
Spin and hold, spin and
hold, spin and hold...

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.820
The last part is a bit fast.

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:40.720
Ready and... Raise up your hands, tilt your
neck, and spin around once!

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:46.030
Now, once more
with the music.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:55.490
ienakatta kotoba ga arun da

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:58.770
Okay!

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:01.740
Finally, let's try doing all of
today's lesson together!

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:02.980
Good luck!

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:10.170
sou ieba ima made chanto

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:18.900
ienakatta kotoba ga arun da

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:22.030
Was everyone able to do it?

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:24.560
Good luck on the next Lesson!

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:32.630
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.450
Shugo Chara Talk!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:39.820
And now it's what you've
all been waiting for:

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.290
Shugo Chara Talk's Final
Battle of Supremacy!

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:45.490
These people here are
today's participants!

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:53.160
Everyone will give an interesting speech,
and the best one will win the prize!

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:56.020
The judge will be Pepe-san!

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:59.060
Today's theme is...

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:01.590
A "Dokki Doki" story!

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:03.410
Ran-san is up first!

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:04.200
Right!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.540
Yesterday, you see...

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.610
I dashed off and couldn't
stop again! It was awful!

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:12.070
I dodged a cat and was
about to hit a train...

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:13.040
It was all "Dokki Doki!"

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:15.930
But I barely avoided them all!

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:17.970
That's it?

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.100
Yes, and...

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:21.140
That was too predictable. So-so...

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.550
What the heck? Lemme out!

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:32.150
When Pepe-chan makes an X,
you fail, and are trapped in an egg!

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:35.890
S-Seriously?

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.000
What're we gonna do?

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:40.580
All we gotta do is not tell
a dumb story like Ran.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:43.970
When one says "Dokki Doki" a number
of meanings come to mind...

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:45.610
Nervous Dokki Doki...

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:47.310
I screwed up Dokki Doki...

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:50.280
And having a wonderful time with
a special someone Dokki Doki...

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:52.220
So you see, today I...

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:56.050
Hey! I haven't even
started yet!

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.680
Your buildup went
too long-dechu.

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.260
Cool...

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.200
All right!

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:02.700
In that case, I'll get straight
to the point!

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.360
When you say Dokki Doki...

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:05.520
Why?!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.850
It's a mystery to everyone.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:11.280
Anyway, we've got to
play to Pepe's tastes!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.630
I-I don't really get it, but
I'm gonna do my best!

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:19.370
Um you see, lately the old standby jokes aren't
working so good, so I was all Dokki Doki!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.120
But in the end everybody
finally laughed!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.020
I knew it!

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:26.000
You skipped ahead
too fast-dechu.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.420
Please pay more heed to proper
literary development.

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:31.520
What should I talk about?

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:33.670
I'm all Dokki Doki right now!

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.530
Last up is Rhythm-san!

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:36.960
R-Right...

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:39.930
I once had this happen to me.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.130
It was Dokki Doki and
soulful... ow!

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:43.860
I bith my tongth!

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:46.650
You pass-dechu!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:49.060
Rhythm-san is the winner!

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.480
That wasn't a Dokki
Doki story at all!

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:55.520
It was funny, so who
cares-dechu?

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:55.940
See you again!

00:09:56.650 --> 00:10:00.030
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:03.620
Today's episode is "Believe
in my Pure Heart!"

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:06.030
I can't wait to see what happens
after last week's episode!

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:09.290
Yeah! And today, Rikka-chan finally...

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.460
What? What? I wanna know!

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.270
What is it?

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:12.950
What?

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:14.340
Coming up next!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:28.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:32.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:42.820
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:48.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:53.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:58.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:06.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:12.290
I have something to say.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:18.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:24.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:29.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:36.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:48.140
Amu-chan, look!

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:55.570
That's Rikka-chan's room.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:59.050
Why did so many X eggs
fly out of Rikka's room?

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:01.990
Anyway, we'll chase
after the X eggs.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.550
You and Hotori-kun
hurry on inside.

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:06.750
Got it. Let's go, Amu-chan!

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:07.800
Right!

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:14.080
24 - Believe in
my Pure Heart!

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:15.860
Rikka!

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:17.790
Rikka!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.190
What in the...

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:21.960
Rikka, are you okay?

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.430
Did something happen, Rikka?

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.330
Amu-senpai...

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:29.240
The X egg burst...

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:33.760
What should I do?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:42.860
I couldn't leave
them all alone.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:47.090
I'm sorry for keeping them
a secret from you.

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:48.410
So that's what it was.

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:51.930
But, what happened to them?

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:56.920
They're usually so well behaved...
Why did they do this to the room?

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:03.720
Rikka, what did you mean
the X egg burst?

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.510
I don't know.

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:08.220
I went to touch it and
then suddenly...

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:12.290
I can't believe an X egg
would burst like that...

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:18.100
The sadness within the X egg was likely
so great, it couldn't stand it.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.650
So, if they are stressed
any more...

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:28.570
All right, let's go after them!

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:37.780
This is...

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.830
What a wave of sadness...

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:43.070
They're destroying
themselves...

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:46.510
What happens to an
X egg that bursts?

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:47.850
Well...

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:51.680
Bursting on its own is a decision
it makes of its own will.

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:54.930
It is likely a decision that
can't be taken back.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:56.750
Oh, no! Why?

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:58.610
What happened to them?

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:03.020
It seems that the X eggs were just
trying to clean up the room.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:08.290
But they couldn't do it right,
and messed up the room.

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:10.240
That's what Mr. Catfish said.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:13.390
They also tried to bring
you the paints.

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.240
The paints?

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:21.160
So they really were trying
their best for Rikka-chan.

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:22.930
They weren't being bad.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:24.970
They were a nice
bunch of X eggs.

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:26.980
And yet, I...

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:30.950
I don't wanna see
you ever again!

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:34.640
Go away, and never
come back!

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:41.560
It's because I said something
like that to them...

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:43.970
Rikka-chan...

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:49.030
I didn't pay enough attention to
them after Hotaru was born!

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:50.610
They must have been lonely!

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:53.650
This is all my fault!

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:59.070
Rikka! Get a hold of yourself!

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:04.690
Amu-senpai...

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.950
You might still have time!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:11.050
There might be ones
left you can save!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.170
Aren't they your friends?!

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:17.600
Yes!

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:21.620
Dia!

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:22.140
Right!

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:26.650
My Heart: Unlock!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.430
Character Transformation:
Amulet Diamond!

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.780
What're we going to do?

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.980
If we chase them too
much, they burst.

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:52.070
Even just touching them,
they might...

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:54.570
We can't do anything!

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.200
What is this?

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.150
At this rate...

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:06.600
Amu!

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.230
Amu-chan!

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:09.060
Amu!

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:11.400
Amu-chan!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.030
Everyone!

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:15.160
Twinkle Hold!

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:26.790
Amu-chan, any more than
this will be dangerous.

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.730
Even Diamond's attacks
won't work...

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:32.440
What in the world can we do?

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:33.900
I'm sorry!

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:38.920
Everyone...

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:46.430
Yeah... You believed in me...

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:48.610
You must be really
sad. I'm sorry.

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:54.150
This is all my fault!

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:58.420
Sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.130
Rikka!

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:12.860
It'll be okay, got it?

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:15.380
I won't make you sad
anymore, I promise!

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:17.590
Everything'll be fine!

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:25.370
Everyone, come to me!

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:27.780
I'll protect you all!

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:30.210
No matter what!

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:34.360
My Heart: Unlock!

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:51.660
Character Transformation:
Pure Feeling!

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:54.950
Rikka-chan...

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.050
...Character Transformed!

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:58.170
I...

00:17:58.170 --> 00:17:59.950
Rikka, let's do it!

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.480
Amu-senpai!

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:05.220
I think you can make them understand
your feelings, Rikka.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.140
Right!

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:14.850
Everyone, there's no need
to feel lonely anymore!

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:16.430
Impossible!

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:17.800
It is possible!

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:21.320
You know how kind Rikka is
better than anyone else!

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:26.980
You're all my precious friends!

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:28.810
So, believe in me!

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:42.010
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:45.570
Open Heart!

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:22.060
They're returned
to Hearts' Eggs!

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:23.290
All right!

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:24.850
It's a miracle!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.210
Thank goodness! I'm so happy!

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:32.060
Thank you so much, Amu-senpai!

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.320
Come here, everyone!

00:19:36.060 --> 00:19:38.200
Oh, right...

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:41.710
You're all leaving
now, aren't you?

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:49.410
I'm... so glad you all returned to normal...

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:54.720
Oh yeah... I should give you
something as a farewell present...

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:55.580
Rikka-chan!

00:19:57.650 --> 00:20:02.480
Thank you for lending
a kind ear.

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:06.270
It made us very happy.

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:10.040
Being together was
a lot of fun.

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:11.890
It warmed our hearts.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.520
It was so much fun...

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:20.150
It was fun for me, too!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:31.780
Everyone, don't get
lost now, okay?

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:34.160
Thank you for everything!

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:43.420
Hey, don't turn back! You don't
have to worry about me.

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:47.880
That's impossible!

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:05.030
I love you all!

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:18.720
I hope they all went back
to their owners.

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:23.790
I'm sure they will. Rikka's feelings
made it through to them.

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:38.020
Yo.

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:43.560
Why are <i>you</i> here?!

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:48.200
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.330
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:56.140
Which egg will be
the lucky one?

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:01.900
Guardian Egg Studying Fortune!

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:04.370
First up, for the people
who picked Su's egg...

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:07.420
4 Shugoluck stars!
Super lucky!

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:10.290
Even if you're starting something
new, you'll be in top shape!

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:12.720
Challenge through anything
that comes your way!

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:14.990
Ran's egg is 3 Shugoluck stars.

00:22:14.990 --> 00:22:17.910
Someone might teach you a
way to raised your grades.

00:22:17.910 --> 00:22:19.480
Miki's egg is 2 Shugoluck Stars.

00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:22.340
Don't get bogged down
in calculations!

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:25.680
Finally, for those of you
who chose Dia's egg...

00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:29.150
Awoo! It's the worst luck
of all, 1 Shugoluck star!

00:22:29.150 --> 00:22:33.270
Thanks to a mistake of yours during class,
you'll cause trouble for everyone!

00:22:33.270 --> 00:22:35.850
Make sure to apologize properly,
and make a comeback!

00:22:35.850 --> 00:22:38.190
Your lucky item
is a key holder.

00:22:39.310 --> 00:22:41.220
Today sure was fun!

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:43.680
See you on the next
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:47.170
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:47.170 --> 00:22:49.050
Bye-bye!

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:20.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:27.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:30.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:33.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:37.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:43.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:48.590
you're sure to become lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:55.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:55.670 --> 00:24:00.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:11.640
Each time you get closer to who you
want to be, they'll be given birth:

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:14.260
Our Songs!
